{{afc comment|1=appears it is complete now. This one was really tiny[[User:Immanuelle|Immanuelle]] ([[User talk:Immanuelle|talk]]) 03:34, 20 March 2025 (UTC)}} {{afc comment|1=both of these are kind of weird half-done Shikinaisha lists. Hence they were moved before I got a proper system set up for minimally translating each page before I moved it to its final destination. Please check this through until it reaches bare minimum translation standards and then move it to its standardized location[[User:Immanuelle|Immanuelle]] ([[User talk:Immanuelle|talk]]) 03:30, 20 March 2025 (UTC)}} {{afc comment|1=Switching over to deprecating the templates. So things might be a bit unexpected.[[User:Immanuelle|Immanuelle]] ([[User talk:Immanuelle|talk]]) 05:01, 18 March 2025 (UTC)}} {{afc comment|1=If this is in the format "List of Shikinaisha in X" then I have linked all existing shrines into the table. Otherwise I have not. Translation of the texts will come later as it is a lot less difficult than the tables. Exception if there is another comment explaining the exception below[[User:Immanuelle|Immanuelle]] ([[User talk:Immanuelle|talk]]) 05:34, 17 March 2025 (UTC)}} '''Inaba Province の式内社一覧'''（いなばのくにのしきないしゃいちらん）は、『[[Engishiki]]』第9巻・第10巻「神名帳上下」（[[延喜式神名帳]]）に記載のある[[神社]]、いわゆる「[[式内社]]」およびその[[論社]]のうち、[[Inaba Province ]]に分類されている神社の一覧。
また『延喜式』神名帳の編纂当時に存在したが同帳に記載の無い神社、いわゆる「[[式外社]]」についても付記する。
